		"Picks up and places items between machines."
	]
	quest.E17A9DE819FE4B0D.title: "Mechanical Arm"
	quest.E3A677EAB095C8E7.quest_desc: [
		"More power, no river needed."
	]
	quest.E3A677EAB095C8E7.title: "Windmill"
	quest.E702A41C8850A300.quest_desc: [
		"Paint your gear any colour you like."
	]
	quest.E702A41C8850A300.title: "A Splash of Colour"
	quest.EBE2E9D7B112391A.quest_desc: [
		"Blueprints and templates shape the parts. Craft a blueprint for the part you want, then craft it with your material."
	]
	quest.EBE2E9D7B112391A.title: "Blueprints"
	quest.ECC25586EC50AADA.quest_desc: [
		"Every tool and piece of armour here is built from &eparts&r: a head, a rod, sometimes a binding or grip."
		"Each part's material decides the stats. Hover a tool and hold Shift to see them."
		""
		"Better materials come from exploring. You won't know which metal is best until you find it."
	]
	quest.ECC25586EC50AADA.title: "Look Closer at Your Pickaxe"
	quest.EEA9A940BEB15687.quest_desc: [
		"Take your ship above &bY 250&r and bring it back in one piece."
	]
	quest.EEA9A940BEB15687.title: "First Flight"
	quest.EF3A8F11B527ABAD.quest_desc: [
		"Blow through fire to smelt, through water to wash."
	]
	quest.EF3A8F11B527ABAD.title: "Encased Fan"
	quest.F0E6D2A6339B8D62.quest_desc: [
		"Metal quests stay hidden until you hold the metal. Rumours so far:"
		"&7-&r Something red runs in the walls of the Nether."
		"&7-&r Blue veins are said to glitter in the End."
		"&7-&r Black crystals hide deep below the stone."
		"&7-&r Some of the best metals aren't mined at all. They're alloyed."
		""
		"The &eFoundry&r (Alloy Age) casts parts and doubles your ore."
